دْ"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "ٱسْجُدِى", "plain": "اُسْجُدِي", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/a794c0fdd22236a704be.m4a", "recited": "audio/f21523d8a9ef7a9fd6c5.m4a", "recitedText": "وَٱسْجُدِى"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اُسْجُدَا", "plain": "اُسْجُدَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/94a1debb35b3e430c292.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "ٱسْجُدُوا۟", "plain": "اُسْجُدُوا", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/e2b711d619d083c7021f.m4a", "recited": "audio/4fc6eb29c94b1681db37.m4a", "recitedText": "ٱسْجُدُوا۟"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اُسْجُدْنَ", "plain": "اُسْجُدْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/c72e4e18f57a2ea01c19.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "53:62", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4846.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Rather prostrate yourselves before Allah and serve Him.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Haydi Allah için secdeye kapanın ve O'na kulluk edin.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو اللہ کے لیے سجدہ اور اس کی بندگی کرو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka bersujudlah kepada Allah dan sembahlah (Dia).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَٱسْجُدُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d6bc858b0a799286ccbd.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa učinite sedždu", "en": "so prostrate", "tr": "öyleyse secde edin", "fr": "alors prosternez-vous", "id": "maka bersujudlah", "ur": "پس سجدہ کرو", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা সিজদা করো", "fa": "پس سجده کنید"}}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱعْبُدُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "20:116", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2464.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And when We said unto the angels: Fall prostrate before Adam, they fell prostrate (all) save Iblis; he refused.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bir vakit meleklere: \"Âdem(e hürmet) için secde edin\" demiştik; İblis'ten başka hepsi secde etmiş, o çekinmişti.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور جب ہم نے فرشتوں سے فرمایا کہ آدم کو سجدہ کرو تو سب سجدہ میں گرے مگر ابلیس، اس نے نہ مانا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan (ingatlah) ketika Kami berkata kepada malaikat: \"Sujudlah kamu kepada Adam\", maka mereka sujud kecuali iblis. Ia membangkang.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قُلْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱسْجُدُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c06efab8c23d08ed1f20.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "(you all) prostrate!", "bs": "učinite sedždu!", "tr": "secde edin!", "fr": "prosternez-vous !", "id": "sujudlah kalian!", "ur": "سجدہ کرو!", "bn": "সিজদা কর!", "fa": "سجده کنید!"}}, {"text": "لِءَادَمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَسَجَدُوٓا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a6aae774495ef364ec03.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so they prostrated", "bs": "pa su učinili sedždu", "tr": "böylece secde ettiler", "fr": "alors ils se sont prosternés", "id": "maka mereka telah sujud", "ur": "پس انہوں نے سجدہ کیا", "bn": "অতএব তারা সিজদা করল", "fa": "پس سجده کردند"}}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِبْلِيسَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَبَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "84:21", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5905.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And, when the Qur'an is recited unto them, worship not (Allah)?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Karşılarında Kur'ân okunduğu vakit secde etmezler?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور جب قرآن پڑھا جائے سجدہ نہیں کرتے السجدة ۔۱۳", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan apabila Al Quran dibacakan kepada mereka, mereka tidak bersujud,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قُرِئَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْقُرْءَانُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَسْجُدُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/83a65e3d8c0e347d39ff.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they prostrate", "bs": "čine sedždu", "tr": "secde ederler", "fr": "ils se prosternent", "id": "mereka sujud", "ur": "وہ سجدہ کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা সিজদা করে", "fa": "سجده می‌کنند"}}]}, {"ref": "13:15", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1722.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And unto Allah falleth prostrate whosoever is in the heavens and the earth, willingly or unwillingly, as do their shadows in the morning and the evening hours.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Oysa göklerde ve yerde kim varsa ister istemez kendileri de gölgeleri de sabah akşam Allah'a secde ederler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اللہ ہی کو سجدہ کرتے ہیں جتنے آسمانوں اور زمین میں ہیں خوشی سے خواہ مجبوری سے اور ان کی پرچھائیاں ہر صبح و شام السجدة ۔۲", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Hanya kepada Allah-lah sujud (patuh) segala apa yang di langit dan di bumi, baik dengan kemauan sendiri ataupun terpaksa (dan sujud pula) bayang-bayangnya di waktu pagi dan petang hari.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلِلَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَسْجُدُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/9982820a09adcc1aeba3.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it prostrates", "bs": "čini sedždu", "tr": "secde eder", "fr": "il se prosterne", "id": "dia sujud", "ur": "وہ سجدہ کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে সিজদা করে", "fa": "سجده می‌کند"}}, {"text": "مَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "طَوْعًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكَرْهًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَظِلَٰلُهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْغُدُوِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْءَاصَالِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "15:30", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1832.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So the angels fell prostrate, all of them together", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bunun üzerine meleklerin hepsi toptan secde ettiler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو جتنے فرشتے تھے سب کے سب سجدے میں گرے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka bersujudlah para ma